{"seq":3,"slug":"linkage-governance-falsepositive-metric","title":"关联治理覆盖率/误伤/复发度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/seller-multistore-account-linkage-governance/linkage-lifecycle-integration/linkage-governance-falsepositive-metric","wordCount":2317,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"关联治理覆盖率-误伤-复发度量\">关联治理覆盖率/误伤/复发度量</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>治理体系如果无法度量自身效果，就只能在盲目中运营——既不知道漏了多少，也不知道冤枉了多少。本节建立三个核心指标族：覆盖率（漏）、误伤率（冤）、复发率（白干），以及它们的分层口径与使用方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三个指标族的定义\">三个指标族的定义</h2><p>三个指标回答三个不同的问题，且必须同时看——只看任何一个都会被误导。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三指标族的定义对照\">三指标族的定义对照</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标族</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>分子</th>\n<th>分母</th>\n<th>过高/过低的含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>覆盖率</td>\n<td>现有违规被发现了多少</td>\n<td>被发现的关联违规簇</td>\n<td>实际存在的关联违规簇</td>\n<td>低 = 漏放严重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>误伤率</td>\n<td>被处置的有多少是错的</td>\n<td>被推翻的处置</td>\n<td>全部处置</td>\n<td>高 = 阈值过松</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复发率</td>\n<td>处置后是否换壳重来</td>\n<td>复发主体数</td>\n<td>已处置主体数</td>\n<td>高 = 处罚无效</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"共同难点-分母不可观测\">共同难点：分母不可观测</h3><p>三个指标都有共同的测量难点：<strong>分母不可直接观测</strong>。没有谁能在全平台标注出「实际存在的关联违规簇」的真值。因此每个指标都需要一个可操作的代理口径，代理口径的选择决定了指标的可用性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"覆盖率-用捕获-再捕获估计真值\">覆盖率：用捕获-再捕获估计真值</h2><p>覆盖率的分母是「实际存在的关联违规」。直接测量不可能，但可以用捕获-再捕获（capture-recapture）方法估计总体规模：用两条相互独立的检测路径分别去发现违规簇，比较两者的重叠度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"估计量与独立性前提\">估计量与独立性前提</h3><p>设路径 A 发现 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个簇，路径 B 发现 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个簇，两者重叠 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{AB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个，则在两条路径独立的前提下，总体规模估计为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>N</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{N} = \\frac{n_A \\cdot n_B}{n_{AB}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9575em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1215em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>覆盖率即为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>∪</mo><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>N</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{|A \\cup B|}{\\hat{N}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4827em;vertical-align:-0.4727em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5273em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord accent mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span><span style=\"top:-2.9523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∪</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4727em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这个方法的关键前提是<strong>两条路径的独立性</strong>。如果路径 A 和 B 都基于同一套信号（例如都是设备指纹的变体），重叠度会虚高，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>N</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 被严重低估，覆盖率被高估。</p>\n<p>这个估计量就是生态学中的 Lincoln–Petersen 估计量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>N</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{N} = nK/k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>。文献明确列出它的三条前提：种群闭合（两次抽样之间没有个体迁入迁出）、标记可识别且记录无误、以及<strong>等捕获概率</strong>——即此前被捕获过不应改变再次被捕获的概率，这正对应「两条检测路径相互独立」（来源：<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_and_recapture\">Mark and recapture</a>）。违反等捕获概率会直接给出有偏估计：重捕过多则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 偏大、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>N</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 偏小，重捕过少则反之。这解释了为什么用同源信号构造两条路径会系统性高估覆盖率。</p>\n<h3 id=\"路径的独立性分级\">路径的独立性分级</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>路径组合</th>\n<th>独立性</th>\n<th>可用性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主体信号 vs 资金信号</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设备信号 vs IP 信号</td>\n<td>低（同源）</td>\n<td>不可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>入驻预检 vs 持续监控</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动检测 vs 人工举报</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>推荐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行「自动检测 vs 人工举报」是实践中性价比最高的组合：举报是外部输入，与内部规则的相关性较低，两者的重叠度能较好反映真实漏放。</p>\n<h2 id=\"误伤率-按等级与动机分层\">误伤率：按等级与动机分层</h2><p>误伤率的分子（被推翻的处置）容易统计，但<strong>必须分层</strong>，因为不同证据等级、不同动机下的合理误伤率基线完全不同。</p>\n<h3 id=\"按等级与动作分层统计\">按等级与动作分层统计</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 分层误伤率: 按证据等级与动作级别&#10;WITH enforcement AS (&#10;  SELECT a.action_id, a.tier, a.action_code, a.cluster_id,&#10;         (a.revoked_at IS NOT NULL) AS revoked&#10;  FROM enforcement_action a&#10;  WHERE a.effective_at &gt;= now() - INTERVAL &#39;180 days&#39;&#10;)&#10;SELECT tier, action_code,&#10;       COUNT(*) AS total,&#10;       COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE revoked) AS revoked_cnt,&#10;       ROUND(100.0 * COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE revoked) / COUNT(*), 2) AS revoke_pct&#10;FROM enforcement&#10;GROUP BY tier, action_code&#10;ORDER BY tier, action_code;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 分层误伤率: 按证据等级与动作级别</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> enforcement </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">action_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">action_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cluster_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">revoked_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> revoked</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> enforcement_action a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">effective_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'180 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tier, action_code,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> revoked) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> revoked_cnt,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> revoked) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> revoke_pct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> enforcement</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tier, action_code</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tier, action_code;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>分层的理由是：L1 确证级处置的合理撤销率应接近零（若不为零，说明数据源有问题），L3 推论级处置的撤销率可能到 10–15% 仍属正常（因为它触发的是轻处置）。把两者混在一起算总撤销率，会掩盖真正的问题。</p>\n<h3 id=\"按动机分层定位误伤来源\">按动机分层定位误伤来源</h3><p>除了按等级，还应<strong>按动机分层</strong>。<a href=\"../multistore-policy-legit-exception/linkage-evasion-motivation\">关联逃逸动机</a> 区分了规避封禁、重复铺货、刷单隔离、差评隔离、资质规避五类，各类的信号可靠性差异很大——例如「重复铺货」的 SKU 重合信号在正规分销场景里误伤率天然偏高。按动机分层能定位到底是哪类判定在制造误伤。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复发率-处罚是否真的有效\">复发率：处罚是否真的有效</h2><p>复发率衡量处罚的威慑效果：被处置的主体是否在处置后以新的关联店铺重新出现。它的测量需要<strong>主体身份在时间上的连续性</strong>——这正是 <a href=\"../linkage-signal-graph/ubo-company-legal-link\">UBO 强关联</a> 与图谱提供的价值。</p>\n<h3 id=\"复发的判定口径\">复发的判定口径</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"复发 = 处置后 T 天内, 出现与该主体存在 L1/L2 关联的活跃新店铺\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>复发 = 处置后 T 天内, 出现与该主体存在 L1/L2 关联的活跃新店铺</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"各动作的复发率特征\">各动作的复发率特征</h3><p>复发率的分层同样重要，且它揭示了不同处罚动作的有效性差异：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>处置动作</th>\n<th>预期复发率特征</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>警告（A1）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>无实质成本，威慑弱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>限流（A2）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>有损失但可恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强制分账（A3）</td>\n<td>中低</td>\n<td>触及现金流，成本高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合并主体（A4）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>结构被改变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关联封禁（A5）</td>\n<td>低但周期长</td>\n<td>需配合设备/资金封禁</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>若某个动作的复发率接近其前一级，说明该动作没有产生增量威慑，应考虑调整或取消该级别——这是梯度设计是否合理的实证检验。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三个指标的联合解读\">三个指标的联合解读</h2><p>单独看任何一个指标都会得出错误结论。三个指标必须联合解读：</p>\n<h3 id=\"病态组合的诊断树\">病态组合的诊断树</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;覆盖率低&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;误伤率?&quot;}&#10;  B -- 也低 --&gt; C[&quot;阈值过严&lt;br/&gt;大量漏放, 需放宽&quot;]&#10;  B -- 高 --&gt; D[&quot;检测能力不足&lt;br/&gt;靠激进规则凑数&quot;]&#10;  A[&quot;覆盖率正常&quot;] --&gt; E{&quot;误伤率?&quot;}&#10;  E -- 高 --&gt; F[&quot;阈值过松&lt;br/&gt;需收紧并加人工复核&quot;]&#10;  E -- 低 --&gt; G{&quot;复发率?&quot;}&#10;  G -- 高 --&gt; H[&quot;处置力度不足&lt;br/&gt;封而不绝&quot;]&#10;  G -- 低 --&gt; I[&quot;治理有效, 维持并监控漂移&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"覆盖率低\"] --&gt; B{\"误伤率?\"}\n  B -- 也低 --&gt; C[\"阈值过严&lt;br/&gt;大量漏放, 需放宽\"]\n  B -- 高 --&gt; D[\"检测能力不足&lt;br/&gt;靠激进规则凑数\"]\n  A[\"覆盖率正常\"] --&gt; E{\"误伤率?\"}\n  E -- 高 --&gt; F[\"阈值过松&lt;br/&gt;需收紧并加人工复核\"]\n  E -- 低 --&gt; G{\"复发率?\"}\n  G -- 高 --&gt; H[\"处置力度不足&lt;br/&gt;封而不绝\"]\n  G -- 低 --&gt; I[\"治理有效, 维持并监控漂移\"]</pre><p>四种典型病态组合各有处方：<strong>低覆盖 + 低误伤</strong>说明系统过于保守，大量违规被放过；<strong>低覆盖 + 高误伤</strong>是能力不足却用激进规则凑数，最危险；<strong>正常覆盖 + 高误伤</strong>是阈值失准，需要收紧并加强人工复核；<strong>正常覆盖 + 低误伤 + 高复发</strong>说明发现得准但处罚太轻，封了又换壳回来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"度量驱动的规则演进\">度量驱动的规则演进</h2><p>指标的最终用途是驱动规则改进，形成闭环。</p>\n<h3 id=\"指标异常到改进动作的映射\">指标异常到改进动作的映射</h3><p>具体的映射关系如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标异常</th>\n<th>根因假设</th>\n<th>改进行动</th>\n<th>归属章节</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>某信号推翻率高</td>\n<td>权重或基线失准</td>\n<td>重估该信号权重与分区基线</td>\n<td>第 2 章</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>覆盖率长期低</td>\n<td>信号覆盖不足</td>\n<td>引入新信号源（供应链/物流）</td>\n<td>第 2 章</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>某等级误伤高</td>\n<td>阈值过松</td>\n<td>校准门槛参数</td>\n<td>第 3 章</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复发率高</td>\n<td>处置力度不足</td>\n<td>提升梯度或扩展封禁维度</td>\n<td>第 3 章</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预检漏检集中</td>\n<td>预检查询类型不足</td>\n<td>增加预检信号</td>\n<td>第 4 章</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这个映射表是治理体系的自我诊断清单。它把抽象的指标异常翻译成具体的工程动作，避免「指标不好看但不知道该改什么」的僵局。</p>\n<h2 id=\"指标本身的陷阱\">指标本身的陷阱</h2><p>最后要警惕度量本身的失效模式，它们会让指标体系产生虚假的安慰。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四种失效模式\">四种失效模式</h3><p><strong>代理指标取代目标</strong>：如果团队被考核「撤销率降低」，最容易的做法是让申诉更难通过，而非提高判定质量。防御是同时看撤销率与申诉受理量、处理时效。</p>\n<p><strong>标注偏差</strong>：人工复核的结论被当作真值，但复核者本身可能有系统性倾向（例如倾向于维持机器的判定以省事）。防御是定期做盲标注校准，让复核者在不知道机器结论的前提下判断。</p>\n<p><strong>分母漂移</strong>：捕获-再捕获的独立性假设会随规则演化而失效——当两条路径逐渐共享信号源时，覆盖率会被系统性高估。防御是定期重验路径独立性，例如检查两条路径发现的簇在信号构成上是否高度相似。</p>\n<p><strong>度量窗口过短</strong>：复发需要时间显现，若只看 30 天窗口，长周期的换壳复现会被完全遗漏。防御是按多个时间窗（30/90/180 天）分别统计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>三个核心指标族：覆盖率（漏）、误伤率（冤）、复发率（白干）；必须联合解读，单看任一个都会误导。</li>\n<li>覆盖率的分母用捕获-再捕获估计，前提是所选两条检测路径语义独立；「自动检测 + 人工举报」是实践中最好的组合。</li>\n<li>误伤率必须按证据等级与动机分层，各级别的合理基线不同，混合统计会掩盖问题。</li>\n<li>复发率用图谱的身份连续性测量，不同处置动作的复发率差异可直接检验梯度设计的合理性。</li>\n<li>四种病态指标组合各有处方；指标异常应映射到具体的信号、阈值或动作改进，形成演进闭环。</li>\n<li>度量本身有四种陷阱：代理指标取代目标、标注偏差、分母漂移、窗口过短，都需要显式的防御措施。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>相关阅读：处置动作与状态见<a href=\"../linkage-evidence-adjudication/linked-store-enforcement-ladder\">关联处置梯度</a>，申诉数据如何回流见<a href=\"../linkage-evidence-adjudication/seller-appeal-evidence-process\">卖家申诉、举证与解关联复议</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"关联治理覆盖率/误伤/复发度量","id":"关联治理覆盖率-误伤-复发度量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三个指标族的定义","id":"三个指标族的定义"},{"level":3,"text":"三指标族的定义对照","id":"三指标族的定义对照"},{"level":3,"text":"共同难点：分母不可观测","id":"共同难点-分母不可观测"},{"level":2,"text":"覆盖率：用捕获-再捕获估计真值","id":"覆盖率-用捕获-再捕获估计真值"},{"level":3,"text":"估计量与独立性前提","id":"估计量与独立性前提"},{"level":3,"text":"路径的独立性分级","id":"路径的独立性分级"},{"level":2,"text":"误伤率：按等级与动机分层","id":"误伤率-按等级与动机分层"},{"level":3,"text":"按等级与动作分层统计","id":"按等级与动作分层统计"},{"level":3,"text":"按动机分层定位误伤来源","id":"按动机分层定位误伤来源"},{"level":2,"text":"复发率：处罚是否真的有效","id":"复发率-处罚是否真的有效"},{"level":3,"text":"复发的判定口径","id":"复发的判定口径"},{"level":3,"text":"各动作的复发率特征","id":"各动作的复发率特征"},{"level":2,"text":"三个指标的联合解读","id":"三个指标的联合解读"},{"level":3,"text":"病态组合的诊断树","id":"病态组合的诊断树"},{"level":2,"text":"度量驱动的规则演进","id":"度量驱动的规则演进"},{"level":3,"text":"指标异常到改进动作的映射","id":"指标异常到改进动作的映射"},{"level":2,"text":"指标本身的陷阱","id":"指标本身的陷阱"},{"level":3,"text":"四种失效模式","id":"四种失效模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"持续关联监控与新证据重算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/seller-multistore-account-linkage-governance/linkage-lifecycle-integration/ongoing-linkage-monitoring-rerun"},"next":null}